            "goToSlideType": "specified",
            "invisible": false,
            "solution": ""
          },
          {
            "x": 2.23463687150838,
            "y": 13.245033112582783,
            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Early Life of Louis XVI</strong><br>\nLouis XVI was born on August 23, 1754, in the Palace of Versailles. He was the grandson of Louis XV and became the Dauphin of France when his father died in 1765. Raised in the privileged surroundings of the French royal family, Louis XVI was provided with an education in the humanities, religion, and sciences, but he was not known for being an exceptional student. His hobbies included locksmithing and hunting, activities that remained important to him throughout his life.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Accession to the Throne</strong><br>\nLouis XVI ascended to the throne in 1774 at the age of 20 after the death of his grandfather Louis XV. At the onset, he was determined to be a good king and wanted to improve the lives of his subjects. He was confronted with a difficult financial situation left by his predecessor and a kingdom anxious for change. Despite his good intentions, Louis struggled with decision-making and was often seen as indecisive and easily influenced by others.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Marriage to Marie Antoinette</strong><br>\nIn 1770, Louis XVI married Marie Antoinette, the Archduchess of Austria, to solidify the alliance between France and Austria. Their marriage was initially rocky and unconsummated for several years, leading to public ridicule. However, they eventually had four children. Marie Antoinette's extravagant lifestyle and insensitivity to the economic plight of the French people would later contribute to the royal family's downfall.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
                "defaultLanguage": "en"
              },
              "subContentId": "53bc5361-5ce5-43a9-a00f-57bbceee9cd0"
            },
            "alwaysDisplayComments": false,
            "backgroundOpacity": 0,
            "displayAsButton": false,
